# Everything the build does not read. The build context is sent to the daemon
# in full, so a stray data/ directory with a CA key in it would otherwise be
# shipped to it.
#
# 构建不读取的一切。构建上下文会被整个发送给 daemon，因此一个混在里面、装着 CA 私钥的
# data/ 目录，否则就会被一并送过去。
.git
.github
data
dist
deploy/certs
*.md
**/testdata
**/*_test.go
# Exclude Console dependencies, build output and environment files from Go builds.
# Go 构建同样排除 Console 依赖、构建产物与环境配置文件。
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.env*
# The Console has its own build context and Dockerfile; leaving it in the Go
# context means a frontend-only change invalidates the Go build layer.
# Console 有自己的构建上下文与 Dockerfile；留在 Go 的上下文里，只改前端也会让 Go 构建层失效。
service/aiServeWeaveConsole
# Local agent worktrees are full copies of the repository.
# 本地 agent worktree 是整个仓库的副本。
.claude
